2086
02:12:18.500 --> 02:12:19.390
Tell him.

2087
02:12:19.470 --> 02:12:22.160
Tell him, dear.
Uncle is a busy man.

2088
02:12:22.240 --> 02:12:22.900
Tell him.

2089
02:12:22.980 --> 02:12:25.960
Uncle, uncle,
you were superb in the movie.

2090
02:12:26.040 --> 02:12:28.530
I thoroughly enjoyed your dance.

2091
